@startuml
!include common-sequence-style.pumlinc

title 图4.7 创建订单时序图

actor "用户" as User
participant "<u>:CheckoutView</u>" as CheckoutView
participant "<u>:OrderController</u>" as OrderController
participant "<u>:OrderService</u>" as OrderService
participant "<u>:AddressService</u>" as AddressService
participant "<u>:ProductService</u>" as ProductService
participant "<u>:OrderRepository</u>" as OrderRepository
participant "<u>:CartStore</u>" as CartStore

autonumber 1

User -> CheckoutView : 选择结算商品并提交订单
activate CheckoutView
CheckoutView -> CheckoutView : 校验收货地址、自购限制和预算提醒
CheckoutView -> OrderController : 提交创建订单请求
activate OrderController
OrderController -> OrderService : 创建订单
activate OrderService
OrderService -> AddressService : 校验收货地址
activate AddressService
AddressService --> OrderService : 收货地址
deactivate AddressService
OrderService -> ProductService : 校验商品状态和库存
activate ProductService
ProductService --> OrderService : 商品信息
deactivate ProductService
OrderService -> OrderService : 生成待支付订单和订单项
OrderService -> OrderRepository : 保存待支付订单
activate OrderRepository
OrderRepository --> OrderService : 已保存订单
deactivate OrderRepository
OrderService --> OrderController : 订单数据
deactivate OrderService
OrderController --> CheckoutView : 创建成功
deactivate OrderController
CheckoutView -> CartStore : 删除已结算购物车项
activate CartStore
CartStore --> CheckoutView : 清理结果
deactivate CartStore
CheckoutView --> User : 跳转支付页面
deactivate CheckoutView
@enduml
